    freq[x] += 1
    if x == mex:
        while freq[mex] > 0:
            mex += 1
    suffix_mex[i] = mex
suffix_mex[n] = 0
```
This works if `freq` is large enough to index `x` and `mex`. Since `mex` can go up to n+1, and `x` up to 1e5, we need `freq` size at least max(n, max(nums)) + 2. We'll use `max_val = max(n, max(nums)) + 2`.

